        "text": "An individual selling Christmas trees and decorative cedars in his backyard that he grows on his own. Very nice gentleman, outstanding prices and quality trees that are fresh cut. Highly recommended.",
        "time": 1607471319,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Greg Rajewski",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114625243787701102864/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPW_dfMeZwzyJWY1ZoULxdXTKlYkM2mGKjStKTiMbI0RP6l_SAsw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I went to their business on Friday Dec 8 at 3pm expecting to find them open as advertised on Google Maps (10AM to 5PM, F-Su) or on Facebook (9AM - 4:45PM, Th-Su). There were no signs on their property identifying themselves as Pépinière Martin Potvin or if they were opened or closed. I rang their doorbell because there was a car in the driveway but nobody answered. Not impressed and a total waste of my time. I even reached out via FB Messenger a day earlier, but it was never responded to. They really need to work on their client service (sporadic FB updates, no response to messages, etc.), accuracy in online hours (i.e., Google Maps vs FB), and signage. I was really looking forward to getting my Xmas tree from them this year and will likely not bother next year.",
        "time": 1702079820,
